        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agripa hakumwila Pawulu nindi, Anakwiteji kudi hakwila eyi aweni. Pawulu hakwolola chikasa hakudihakwila; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Eyi mwanta Agripa, natiyi mwani kuwaha kudi hakwila kumesu eyi ifuku ŋalelu, nihiti mwejima mwananholokeluwu kudi aYudeya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa eyi aweni weluka dehi nankashi yaaku yawaYudeya yejima, nimwehu jola ŋawu; dichi nalembi mwani, diwunjiki wuntiyilili chachiwahi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AYudeya ejima aneluki munekalilaŋa mwejima kufumisha kuwukwenzi wami, mukachi kamuza wetu nimuYerusalema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awenawu aneluki kufumisha kutachi, chinadiŋi kaFwarisi, chochaaku chakwitiya kwetu kwasweja kujila. Neyi eteja kushimunamu, adi kushimuna tuhu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nsaŋu yinemeni nakunsompesha yoyakuchiŋeja chuma chakaniniyi Nzambi ankakulula jetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chochakalakelaŋa nyichidi yetu ikumi nayiyedi naŋovu, niwufuku nimwaana, nawu amba kachimona. Kuchiŋejoku diku kunanholokeluwu aYudeya, eyi mwanta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋanyi mwamonaŋa kukala kwitiya chasaŋulaŋayi Nzambi afu?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chalala ami aweni natoŋojokelaŋa nami chachiwahi kwila yuma yayivulu nakudikaŋa nejina daYesu wakuNazareta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eŋaŋi, nelilaŋa muYerusalema mwenimu nawa. Chinatambwili Ŋovu kudi awakulumpi jawatupristu, hinukukasakasa akwakujila amavulu, hinukuyisha namutuleya. Chadiŋi nakuyijahawu, ami nadiŋi nakwitejamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nayibabeshelaŋa kakavulu mwahita mashikola ejima; nesekelaŋa kuyikanjikŋi kulonda atuki Nzambi. Chinaswejelaŋa kuyizuwila neyi kuzaluka hohu, hinukuyikabishaŋa hela kunyikala yakumatuŋa acheŋi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi mwanta, chinadiŋi munjila yami yakuya kuDamakasa namukanda waŋovu wakunyinka kudi awakulumpi jawatupristu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iku nidi munjila, itaŋwa dinashiki dehi mukachi kewulu, hinukumona chejeji chidi nakufuma mwiwulu, chakubadika kutoŋeka kwamwaana wetaŋwa, hichikutoŋekela hinadiŋi ami nawakwetu nendelaŋa nawu kwi-ndo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chitunadimbuki wejima wetu hamaseki hinukutiya izu dakuŋila mwidimi daHeberu nawu, Eyi Sawulu, Sawulu, wankabishilaŋadi? Ochu chiwudi nakusobola kunyumba, yidi nakukulemeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami, Yeyinyi Mwanta? Mwanta nindi, Yami Yesu wankabishaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyamukaku dinu wimani; chinamwekani kudeyi nalondi nikukunjiki kumudimu wakwikala mukwakukalakala nichinsahu, nanochu chiwunanmonami, nichiwamba kanmona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakakupulwisha kudi aYudeya nikudi aJentili kunukukutemesha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kulonda wutoneshi mesu awu, abalumuki afumi kumwidima epili muchejeji; afumi kuŊovu yaSatana ayi kudi Nzambi; kulonda amoni kuyanakena nyiloŋa, atambuli wuswana hamu nanawa aneli ajila nakunkuhwelelami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi mwanta Agripa, chimwenu chamwiwulu chinamweni hinachidiwiluku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinukutachika kushimuna kuDamakasa, nimuYerusalema, nimwahita ituŋa daYudeya dejima, nikudi aJentili nawa, nami abalumuki munyichima atali kudi Nzambi, akoŋi nyidimu yatelela kubalumuka mumuchima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diyi nsaŋu yankwatililuwu aYudeya mutembeli, hiyakweseka nikunjaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chanankwashuwu kudi Nzambi, dichi chinamoni kukakela kushika nikwifuku ŋalelu, nakushimwina nianyanya niamaneni. Hinashimunaŋa yacheŋuku, chiŋa yoyashimwinuwu dehi atuprofwetu naMosi nawu yakenza; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yoyu nsaŋu yakwila nawu Kristu chiŋa akakabi, akekali wakusambila kusaŋuka mudi afu, kulonda kumwekesha nachu chejeji kudi aYudeya nikudi aJentili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chadiŋi nakudihakwilayi Pawulu mwenomu, Fesitusi hakuhosha nezu daŊovu nindi, Eyi Pawulu, wazaluka! Maaneyi asweja diwu anakuzalukishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuchinka Pawulu nindi, Eyi Fesitusi wasweja kulema, hinazalukuku; ilaŋa hinukuhosha mazu alala, amumesu mwawunda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa mwanta wambala nidi nakuhosha nindi chakadi chibeŋu, yena nayiluki yumiyi, ninami nawa neluki chikupu nami yumiyi hiyakuyamba yenaku, muloŋa yumiyi hiyayilili kumbaduku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi mwanta Agripa, atuprofwetu wayiitiyaloŋa? Neluki nami wayiitiyaloŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agripa hakumwila Pawulu nindi, Nakunshinjila chenochu chantesha hohu, keŋa wumbalumuni niikali mukwaKristu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pawulu nindi, Hela chantesha hohu, hela chasweja kuvula, nalombi kudi Nzambi nami, akubalumuni nineyi, niantu ejima adi nakuntiya lelu, mwikali neyi chinekalami; kubula kwanawa maleŋi hohu.",
          "type": "text",
